# Translation file

# Module label 'ModuleQuoteAutoFollowupsName'
ModuleQuoteAutoFollowupsName = Quote Auto Followups
# Module description 'ModuleQuoteAutoFollowupsDesc'
ModuleQuoteAutoFollowupsDesc = Automatic follow-ups for commercial proposals

#
# Permissions
#
Permission34000911 = See follow-up information on quotes
Permission34000912 = Send a follow-up email manually
Permission34000913 = Change follow-up settings of a quote (do not follow up, date sent to customer)

#
# Admin page
#
QuoteAutoFollowupsSetup = Quote Auto Followups
QuoteAutoFollowupsSetupPage = Automatically follows up validated quotes by email, with the PDF attached, to the quote's "Customer contact follow-up" contact. Requires the Scheduled jobs module and a valid sender email address.
QAFSetupSectionSending = Automatic follow-ups
QAFSetupSectionSchedule = Sending schedule
QAFSetupSectionEmail = Follow-up email
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_ENABLED = Enable automatic sending of follow-ups
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_ENABLEDTooltip = If disabled, the scheduled job sends no follow-up. The "Follow up by email" button of quotes remains available.
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_MAX = Maximum number of automatic follow-ups per quote
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_MAXTooltip = Beyond this, the quote is no longer followed up automatically. Manual follow-ups are counted.
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_DELAYS = Follow-up delays (in days)
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_DELAYSTooltip = Comma separated list of delays. Example "7,15,30": 1st follow-up 7 days after the quote was sent to the customer (or validated), 2nd follow-up 15 days after the 1st, 3rd follow-up 30 days after the 2nd. The last delay is reused if the maximum number of follow-ups is higher.
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_START_DATE = Only follow up quotes validated from
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_START_DATETooltip = Quotes validated before this date are not followed up automatically. Set to the current date on activation, so that all older quotes are not followed up at once.
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_BATCH_SIZE = Maximum number of emails sent per run
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_BATCH_SIZETooltip = The scheduled job runs every hour. Pending follow-ups beyond this limit (sent and failed included) are handled by the next runs, most overdue first.
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_HOUR_START = Send from
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_HOUR_STARTTooltip = Server time. Outside the sending window, the scheduled job does nothing.
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_HOUR_END = Send until
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_HOUR_ENDTooltip = Server time (excluded). Outside the sending window, the scheduled job does nothing.
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_WORKDAYS_ONLY = Send from Monday to Friday only
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_SENDER = Sender email address
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_SENDERTooltip = "Sales representative of the quote" uses the email of the user with the "Sales representative following-up proposal" role on the quote, or else the default sender email (Setup > Emails).
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_EMAIL_TEMPLATE = Follow-up email template
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_EMAIL_TEMPLATETooltip = Email templates of type "Commercial proposals" (Setup > Emails > Email templates). The variant in the customer's language is used if it exists (same label). The quote PDF is always attached. Only public templates are listed: the scheduled job cannot use a private template.
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_BCC_MODE = Blind carbon copy of follow-ups
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_BCC_EMAIL = Blind carbon copy address
QUOTEAUTOFOLLOWUPS_BCC_EMAILTooltip = Used when the blind carbon copy is "Fixed address".
QAFBccNone = None
QAFBccSalesRep = Sales representative of the quote
QAFBccFixed = Fixed address
QAFSenderCompany = Company email
QAFSenderRobot = Default sender email
QAFSenderSalesRep = Sales representative of the quote
QAFSenderProfile = Sender profile:
QAFErrorIntegerBetween = "%s" must be an integer between %s and %s.
QAFErrorInvalidDelays = Follow-up delays must be a comma separated list of numbers of days greater than 0 (example: 7,15,30).
QAFErrorBccEmailRequired = Enter the blind carbon copy address, or choose another blind carbon copy mode.
QAFStartDateInitialized = Automatic follow-ups will only apply to quotes validated from %s. You can change this date.
QAFWarningMailsDisabled = Sending emails is disabled in Dolibarr (MAIN_DISABLE_ALL_MAILS): no follow-up will actually be sent.
QAFWarningMailsForcedTo = All emails are redirected to %s (MAIN_MAIL_FORCE_SENDTO): follow-ups are not sent to the quote contacts and the blind carbon copy is dropped.
QAFWarningCronDisabled = The "Quote Auto Followups" scheduled job is not active: automatic follow-ups will not be sent.
QAFWarningNoCompanyEmail = No valid email address is set for the company.
QAFWarningNoRobotEmail = No valid default sender email address is configured.
QAFWarningNoTemplate = No follow-up email template is selected.
QAFWarningTemplateUnavailable = The selected follow-up email template no longer exists, is disabled or is private. Select another one.
QAFWarningSenderProfileUnavailable = The selected sender profile no longer exists, is disabled, is private or has no valid email address. Select another sender.
QAFSubstitutionsTitle = Substitution variables
QAFSubstitutionsHelp = Variables usable in the subject and content of the email template, in addition to all standard variables of commercial proposals.
QAFEditEmailTemplates = Edit email templates of commercial proposals
QAFSubstRef = Quote reference
