QAFSubstThirdpartyName = Third party name
QAFSubstContactCivName = Title and name of the follow-up contact
QAFSubstExpirationDate = End of validity date of the quote
QAFSubstOnlineSignUrl = Online signature link of the quote
QAFSubstFollowupNumber = Follow-up number (1, 2, 3...)
QAFSubstMyCompanyName = Your company name
QAFSubstSenderSignature = Sender signature (sender profile or sales representative)

